                                <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource GuidanceText}">Press Start. All 20 vehicles (numbered 0-19) replay recorded Seattle GPS trajectories at 25 updates/s, as in the <Run Style="{StaticResource Citation}">DEBS 2016 Fig. 5</Run> set-up; nothing moves until you press Start.</TextBlock>
