                                <ContentControl Style="{StaticResource StepNumber}" Content="2"/>
                                <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource GuidanceText}">Press Restricted area or Confinement area, then drag a rectangle on the map; Esc or a right-click cancels. The button stays pressed while you draw, and the map pans as usual at other times. Every vehicle gets a continuous RxIntersect query against each area.</TextBlock>
