                                <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource GuidanceText}"><Run Style="{StaticResource Term}">Red diamond</Run> – inside a restricted area or outside every confinement area (alert).</TextBlock>
                            </DockPanel>
                            <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource GuidanceNote}" Margin="0,6,0,10" Text="Clear areas removes every area and its queries."/>
                            <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource GuidanceNote}">You can switch the spatial index while the demo runs: the alerts are the same on every index, because the queries are exact and the index only prunes which observers are evaluated. The papers compare the indexes on throughput and latency at scale <Run Style="{StaticResource Citation}">(ICDE 2017 Figs. 6, 7 and 12)</Run>, which 20 vehicles cannot show.</TextBlock>
                        </StackPanel>

