                                <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource GuidanceText}">Observe distance is pre-set to 4,600 m, the family-locator set-up of <Run Style="{StaticResource Citation}">DEBS 2016 Fig. 4</Run>. Move it to widen or narrow the bands.</TextBlock>
                            </DockPanel>
